  "description": "A catamaran with a flybridge above the saloon: the best seat on board while you sail, and the place to watch the anchorage at sunset.",
  "details": "A catamaran with a flybridge above the saloon: the best seat on board while you sail, and the place to watch the anchorage at sunset. A Code Zero sail keeps her sailing when the wind is light, and a tender with a 15 HP outboard takes you to the beach when you want to go ashore.\n\nBay Dreamer was refitted in 2022. Below deck: four cabins and four bathrooms, air conditioning in every cabin, a dishwasher in the galley and a watermaker that makes fresh water on board. She also carries Starlink, if anyone needs to stay reachable.",
